      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioners, at the outset, seeks to withdraw this writ petition with liberty to the petitioners to approach the authorities for relief under Section 101-A of the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013, if so advised.",
